stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DECLARED
    DECLARED --> EVIDENCE_BOUND: freeze identity and required evidence
    EVIDENCE_BOUND --> AWAITING_APPROVAL: automated evidence is clear
    EVIDENCE_BOUND --> BLOCKED_IDENTITY: run, source or target drift
    EVIDENCE_BOUND --> BLOCKED_EVIDENCE: evidence missing or digest mismatch
    AWAITING_APPROVAL --> BLOCKED_APPROVAL: rejected, expired or wrong role
    AWAITING_APPROVAL --> BLOCKED_SCOPE: candidate or target scope drift
    AWAITING_APPROVAL --> BLOCKED_COUNT: not enough distinct approvers
    AWAITING_APPROVAL --> APPROVAL_ELIGIBLE: policy fully satisfied
    APPROVAL_ELIGIBLE --> HUMAN_ACTION: release owner reviews evidence
    HUMAN_ACTION --> [*]
    BLOCKED_IDENTITY --> DECLARED: create a new intent
    BLOCKED_EVIDENCE --> EVIDENCE_BOUND: collect fresh evidence
    BLOCKED_APPROVAL --> AWAITING_APPROVAL: request valid approval
    BLOCKED_SCOPE --> DECLARED: bind a new target or candidate
    BLOCKED_COUNT --> AWAITING_APPROVAL: collect distinct approvals
